{
  "suite": "sm_des",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "DES secure messaging: ICAO 9303 P11 App D.4 protected-APDU worked example as an interleaved protect/unprotect session (pins the SSC trajectory, maskClassAndPad, DO87/DO97/DO8E construction and DO87 decrypt); DO97 boundary Le set {1,255,256,65536} plus the latent intToBin Le=300 split; MSE DO97 suppression; error-SW passthrough. Keys are the App D.3 session keys (pre-parity 24-byte forms); non-App-D expected values generated from the port and cross-checked against OpenSSL.",
  "runners": [
    "dart",
    "swift"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
